docs {
  # Admin Get Data Settings
  
  Admin checks the active data provider and markup settings.
  
  Use this request after updating data settings to confirm what is active.

  This endpoint is for the admin dashboard only. Unlike the customer data-plan
  endpoint, it exposes provider routing so admin can see which providers are
  enabled for each network.
  
  If `userPricingTiers` or `vendorPricingTiers` is not empty, tiered pricing is enabled.
  
  If a plan does not match any tier, backend falls back to `userMarkupPercent` or `vendorMarkupPercent`.

  ## Provider Routing Meaning

  `activeProvider`
  Global fallback provider. If a network has no explicit value in
  `networkProviders`, backend uses this provider for that network.

  `networkProviders`
  Object keyed by network. Each network returns an array with one or two provider
  names.

  Example:

  ```json
  {
    "networkProviders": {
      "MTN": ["smeapi", "2fast"],
      "AIRTEL": ["smeplug"],
      "GLO": ["smeplug"],
      "9MOBILE": ["smeplug"]
    }
  }
  ```

  This means:

  - MTN customer plans come from enabled SMEAPI MTN plans and enabled 2Fast MTN
    plans.
  - Airtel, Glo, and 9mobile customer plans come from enabled SME Plug plans.
  - Customers still do not see provider names.

  ## Admin Dashboard Usage

  Use this endpoint to populate provider selectors on the data settings screen.
  For each network, allow admin to select either one provider or two providers.

  Use `availableProviders` to build the provider dropdown/checkbox list.

  To see the actual plans that are visible to customers after this routing is
  applied, call:

  ```txt
  GET /api/v1/admin/services/data/plans?customerVisible=true&sortBy=provider
  ```
  
  ## Endpoint
  
  `GET /api/v1/admin/services/data/settings`
  
  ## Authentication
  
  Admin JWT required.
  
  ## Expected Response
  
  ```json
  {
    "settings": {
      "service": "data",
      "isEnabled": true,
      "activeProvider": "smeapi",
      "networkProviders": {
        "MTN": ["smeapi", "2fast"],
        "AIRTEL": ["smeplug"],
        "GLO": ["smeplug"],
        "9MOBILE": ["smeplug"]
      },
      "availableProviders": [
        {
          "name": "smeapi",
          "available": true
        },
        {
          "name": "ujaydata",
          "available": true
        }
      ],
      "userMarkupPercent": 15,
      "vendorMarkupPercent": 10,
      "userPricingTiers": [
        {
          "minCost": 0,
          "maxCost": 500,
          "markupPercent": 15
        },
        {
          "minCost": 6001,
          "maxCost": null,
          "markupPercent": 3
        }
      ],
      "vendorPricingTiers": [
        {
          "minCost": 0,
          "maxCost": 500,
          "markupPercent": 10
        },
        {
          "minCost": 6001,
          "maxCost": null,
          "markupPercent": 2
        }
      ],
      "roundingMode": "ceil"
    }
  }
  ```
}
